{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199740/extras/PrezentacjaMap.gif?t=1741334410\" /><strong><br>DEFEAT OPPONENTS FROM MULTIPLE DIMENSIONS OR PERISH TRYING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been chosen for a dangerous mission\u2014many have fallen before you. Will you have the determination to complete it? We are counting on you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Diverse Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each opponent has their own unique dimension. Will you be able to visit them all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight with a sword, block enemy attacks, or dodge them! Don't forget about healing, either. The combat system is inspired by Soulslike games but played from a first-person perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Try to Survive Until the End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face five challenging opponents, each with unique abilities. You'll have to learn their attack patterns and find their weaknesses to emerge victorious. If you die, you'll have to start your journey from the beginning...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Speedrun Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to complete the game as quickly as possible with the built-in time-tracking system. Of course, this is entirely optional.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Former Dimension Warrior Kerbs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/e4ad218983b6a57489707c1ed4dceac5cb4180f7.jpg"},{"name":"Queen Arachne","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/94f58f5d25f0f4867348f8e636c818c97de2e7fa.jpg"},{"name":"Prototype Primo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/cbb6a9d2f94f6ce4542cbbd4b183a46b0412b00f.jpg"},{"name":"Balance Master Shadowkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/b56755c9eb578cb5c7e47f88315b4c8d94f96658.jpg"},{"name":"Demigod Hastia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/8f2b61ac30e43fe8cf12d46329434d2cfc4460d3.jpg"},{"name":"Godlike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/c9be3b90a7102ae311be30302ad5109ce4b60ddb.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/b9812e6709143357eb401e80d2df1c3f9bb6b3bc.jpg"},{"name":"No Healing, No Mercy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/61649d67d42d4adb0b2d77b6e9fe1acf89d40f1f.jpg"},{"name":"Exit the loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/183dc2f783955576bd2ab79df100088c66e3c38d.jpg"},{"name":"Speedrunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3199740/dac1ffcf60cf783150ac3cceac7afd21dd99ae3a.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3199740?t=1741334410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741334410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199740/0bfee463ac81d5a96884f11a70d5e3ebab87cac3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741334410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199740/0bfee463ac81d5a96884f11a70d5e3ebab87cac3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741334410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"W mojej grze g\u0142\u00f3wnym elementem rozgrywki jest walka z bossami, kt\u00f3ra obejmuje starcia na miecze i inne rodzaje broni. Chocia\u017c walka jest intensywna, nie zawiera ona realistycznych przedstawie\u0144 krwi czy brutalno\u015bci, kt\u00f3re mog\u0105 by\u0107 nieodpowiednie dla m\u0142odszych graczy. Gra nie zawiera tre\u015bci seksualnych, scen uzale\u017cnienia od narkotyk\u00f3w, ani innych motyw\u00f3w, kt\u00f3re mog\u0142yby by\u0107 wra\u017cliwe dla graczy."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199740/extras/PrezentacjaMap.gif?t=1741334410\" /><strong><br>DEFEAT OPPONENTS FROM MULTIPLE DIMENSIONS OR PERISH TRYING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been chosen for a dangerous mission\u2014many have fallen before you. Will you have the determination to complete it? We are counting on you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore Diverse Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each opponent has their own unique dimension. Will you be able to visit them all?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight with a sword, block enemy attacks, or dodge them! Don't forget about healing, either. The combat system is inspired by Soulslike games but played from a first-person perspective.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Try to Survive Until the End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face five challenging opponents, each with unique abilities. You'll have to learn their attack patterns and find their weaknesses to emerge victorious. If you die, you'll have to start your journey from the beginning...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Speedrun Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to complete the game as quickly as possible with the built-in time-tracking system. Of course, this is entirely optional.</p>","developers":["WrathGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199740/header.jpg?t=1741334410","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257